title: Mo_Start_Day3
---
<<declare $mo_morts_hat to false>>
<<declare $mo_magic_wand to false>>
<<declare $mo_circus_regular  to false>>

<<if $mo_morts_hat is false and $mo_magic_wand is false and $mo_circus_regular is false>>
    Mort: Finally the last day of this burdensome quest has come.
    Mort: Can't say I'll miss it.
    Mort: Let'S keep this short. I've got some important business to catch up on. *yawns*
    You: Alright then. Only a few more questions to go. *chuckles*
    Mort: *blink*
<<elseif $mo_morts_hat is false or $mo_magic_wand is false or $mo_circus_regular is false>>
    Mort: Don't be shy. Ask what you want to ask.
<<endif>>
    -> You: \[top hat\] This doesn't happen to be yours by any chance? <<if $mo_morts_hat is false and $morts_hat is true>>
        <<jump Mo_MortsHat>>
    -> You: \[magic wand\] Did you lose this? <<if $mo_magic_wand is false and $magic_wand is true>>
        <<jump Mo_MagicWand>>
    -> You: Has the circus is resumed it's regular activities, yet? <<if $mo_circus_regular is false>>
        <<jump Mo_CircusRegular>>
    -> You: That would be all. Thank so much for your..
        Mort: *has already vanished behind a circus tent*
===

title: Mo_MortsHat
---
<<set $mo_morts_hat to true>>
Mort: *blinks twice*
Mort: How did you get that? I didn't give you permission to go snooping around in my wagon.
You: I've found it at the crime scene, Mrs. Mort.
Mort: ...very funny. Nw out with it! Who let you into my wagon? Was it Poppet?
Mort: Gods, she always to terribly nosy. She constantly has that ong neck of hers in other peoples business.
You: I wasn't kidding. I really did find the hat in the wagon of the late Mr. Waddles. It was pushed up to the very end of a clothing rack.
Mort: I don't recall getting it mended. I don't think it was damaged...
Mort: Or was it?
Mort: No, no I think I would remember that.
Mort: No wonder the nights felt more quiet recently. I assumed it to be due to old Waddles' departure, but it turns out there were more blessings than one.
Mort: To bad I need to take it back with me. It can't be left in the wrong hands. *looks you up and down*
You: You can pick it up from me when the investigation is completed.
Mort: What do you nee dit for? It won't whisper the name of the murderer to you, if that is what you are hoping for.
You: *you look startled at being caught red handed*
Mort: But I guess I can do with a few more moments od quiet.
<<jump Mo_Start_Day3>>
===

title: Mo_MagicWand
---
<<set $mo_magic_wand to true>>

Mort: Oh, thanks. I must have lost that again.
Mort: Glad I don't need to go an search for it this time. It seems to find the weirdest hiding spots as of late.
You: The wagon of a dead man sure is a strange place to lose something.
Mort: So is was in Waddles wagon? Strange, I don't recall leaving it there..
<<wait  1>>
Mort: ..or ever being in there for that matter.
Mort: What do you think how it ended up in there.
You: Well, I believe you to have dropped it while strangling the light of the late Mr. Waddles eyes. But tat is still a working theory and I'm open to different interpretations on your part.
Mort: Hmmm...
<<wait  1>>
Mort: I'm not sure I can deny your accusation with full certainty. I might have done it and simply forgotten about it. There is just no way to really tell.
Mort: *smiles sinisterly*
Mort: Now I'm intrigued as to what your investigation will result in.
You: *shudders*
<<jump Mo_Start_Day3>>
===

title: Mo_CircusRegular
---
<<set $mo_circus_regular to true>>

Mort: We haven't played any shows since your arrival. But Napoleon did tell everyone that the training is to be resumed and that "the show must go on".
Mort: *rolls her eyes*
Mort: This morning he announced a show for tonight though.
You: That is very soon. Mr. Waddles isn't even in the ground yet.
Mort: I don't know what else you expected. I don't think his death affected anyone much if at all.
Mort: I'm pretty sure we were just on pause because the trumpet penguin castings were still being held.
Mort: But it looks like a replacement Waddles has been found now. I just hope he less of a nuisance.
Mort: I wonder how long this one will make it.
YOu: Excuse me?
Mort: What?
<<jump Mo_Start_Day3>>
===